# Tracked files that may carry the AI-tool name scripts/check-names.sh
# checks for: the exact path, then why. Only functional model
# identifiers in code and tests belong here, never documentation. An
# entry for a file that no longer carries the name fails the check.
crates/audit/src/pricing.toml    The pricing table; the vendor's model identifiers are the keys a call is priced by.
crates/audit/src/pricing.rs      Tests that price those identifiers against the table.
crates/agent/src/runtime.rs      Usage-attribution tests that need a model the pricing table prices.
crates/agent/src/tests.rs        Provider-config and response-parsing tests for the vendor's API and Bedrock, which take the vendor's model identifiers.
